      "sourceTextSha256": "d80b88f1ca47690559f0e5868f620262f85578f8a1564985d72aa7554b124bd0",
      "text": "At the scheduled time, transfer to the airport.\n\nIf time allows, you can visit the **Larco Herrera Museum** along the way.\n\nFounded in the early 20th century, the museum is housed in the 18th-century colonial residence of the Viceroy of Peru.\n\nThe collection comprises more than **45,000 objects**, including ceramics, textiles, jewellery, gold, mummies and a renowned collection of pottery with erotic motifs.\n\nThe exhibits explore the history and daily life of the Inca, Moche, Nazca and Chimú civilisations.\n\n**Cost of the visit:** $65 per person.\n\nThe museum's **Café del Museo** serves Peruvian cuisine.\n\nAfter the visit, continue to the airport for your international flight.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-translator-20261109-mw9q1icj-eexlx1dza",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      }
    },
